ing, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{7}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{7}}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and compute it, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{7{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{{(\\sqrt{7}\\,x)}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}+1}}\\,\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{7}}\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡(\\sqrt{7}\\,x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-95692/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "20b69474-34f6-5539-accf-5ebfc4f6eb0a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-95692"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-96964/selection/7ddb6e78c42009d75d6a9b3bbcc1d4aabb2786e25c8165a6aeea14e5c9c65485" :answer/id #uuid "089c9899-5f33-58a3-81f7-4e6fbc35e5be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96964/selection/1ba80c9ca47568b626408c1c66a9a272f319d4bfd561d840bcbab514dd5912df" :answer/id #uuid "443fa514-7bbb-591a-af19-1e89a638d9c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96964/selection/adc9605022b0e5e9ca6f489920bbe78d752eec91c4f395da87d297f6b11aa391" :answer/id #uuid "d4230a49-7a8c-5bd6-aed3-3af3bd062151" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96964/selection/be2209f8aa0a534ab5511ee890d24a4a3b9681c66c45cf1870ef57255d0a8e71" :answer/id #uuid "ad31fe89-d1a3-5778-9e80-9861035a9bc9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96964/selection/95b490c94f30566955d9597a9caa26d6bab4a2287f7d2412d3b0c745306e273b" :answer/id #uuid "dd6ea4fe-3aaf-59d5-9e3b-f666ab947ed7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96964/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5fa3d2d1-1e52-57f2-ab28-2cdfbd0662e6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-96964/selection/7ddb6e78c42009d75d6a9b3bbcc1d4aabb2786e25c8165a6aeea14e5c9c65485" :answer-field/choices ["q-96964/selection/7ddb6e78c42009d75d6a9b3bbcc1d4aabb2786e25c8165a6aeea14e5c9c65485" "q-96964/selection/1ba80c9ca47568b626408c1c66a9a272f319d4bfd561d840bcbab514dd5912df" "q-96964/selection/adc9605022b0e5e9ca6f489920bbe78d752eec91c4f395da87d297f6b11aa391" "q-96964/selection/be2209f8aa0a534ab5511ee890d24a4a3b9681c66c45cf1870ef57255d0a8e71" "q-96964/selection/95b490c94f30566955d9597a9caa26d6bab4a2287f7d2412d3b0c745306e273b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-96964" :question/id #uuid "c09a1aa7-52df-5b5a-9698-4d7d1276c73c" :question/math-academy-id "q-96964" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{36{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "This integral resembles the basic integral for the inverse hyperbolic sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\n \n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $36{x}^{2}=(6x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=6x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=6\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{6}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and compute it, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{36{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{(6x)^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}+1}}\\,\\cdot (\\frac{1}{6}\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡6x+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-96964/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "20b69474-34f6-5539-accf-5ebfc4f6eb0a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-96964"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-95690/selection/e1d3c87c13c76512ce79cfd1be46e302c6d4d1d34205d903c826163ad435edf1" :answer/id #uuid "7fc7f8b5-d2cd-5a5a-b551-261c313e788a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡{e}^{x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95690/selection/8c8d28e5fd72cd1f583cc0e90dcab011e3cff72a3870657912c11be99d562383" :answer/id #uuid "27f0e22a-1b3c-5f74-931b-10b63ae08068" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2e\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡{e}^{x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95690/selection/fa942bb307437eb84e1b5897eacec994370ef8d9f8125e17082ce138aff46942" :answer/id #uuid "a02bd2dc-9365-58a3-b472-900d28c13553" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡{e}^{x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95690/selection/1877a0e582cd962c628e2360f92fbd371e363c6e60ac2b3905f2e0f51e32c44a" :answer/id #uuid "da76dea3-8043-5815-b23a-d2fc1dc6d25d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "e\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡{e}^{x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95690/selection/5092ecdc46334834fd2d32aeb1a0352743072c77e18c031bcf4f30abbc22e54e" :answer/id #uuid "b27d105b-0874-5daa-8275-9a454da49318" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "e\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡{e}^{x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95690/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c21aa344-5a21-5a0d-942a-73cec2cee122" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-95690/selection/fa942bb307437eb84e1b5897eacec994370ef8d9f8125e17082ce138aff46942" :answer-field/choices ["q-95690/selection/e1d3c87c13c76512ce79cfd1be46e302c6d4d1d34205d903c826163ad435edf1" "q-95690/selection/8c8d28e5fd72cd1f583cc0e90dcab011e3cff72a3870657912c11be99d562383" "q-95690/selection/fa942bb307437eb84e1b5897eacec994370ef8d9f8125e17082ce138aff46942" "q-95690/selection/1877a0e582cd962c628e2360f92fbd371e363c6e60ac2b3905f2e0f51e32c44a" "q-95690/selection/5092ecdc46334834fd2d32aeb1a0352743072c77e18c031bcf4f30abbc22e54e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-95690" :question/id #uuid "2ed400b6-a430-53b9-bebe-b5523b7a7554" :question/math-academy-id "q-95690" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{{e}^{x}}{\\sqrt{{e}^{2x}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "This integral resembles the basic integral for the inverse hyperbolic sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${e}^{2x}={({e}^{x})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u={e}^{x}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{{e}^{x}}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and compute it, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{e}^{x}}{\\sqrt{{e}^{2x}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{{e}^{x}}{\\sqrt{{({e}^{x})}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{u}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}+1}}\\,\\cdot (\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡{e}^{x}+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-95690/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "20b69474-34f6-5539-accf-5ebfc4f6eb0a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-95690"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-95853/selection/dbc5d12323e8e9f481bb84696f68d55945b8cfc91c72b3b702ac1636696079ce" :answer/id