4x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=4x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=4\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and compute it, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(4x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\,\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡4x+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-95432/selection/ma-v1/e1d002a9ebb0209c07d86823bb9c288fe660dfefae199672f9733cf5516d2005"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-95865/selection/164806916f3cabbf1cf9b2a5fb1407438f5e599294470166cb4fc29f4982e9c7" :answer/id #uuid "1959cc2f-b6e3-562d-92c9-3c73cddc9719" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{7}}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{x}{7})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95865/selection/359e6c6aac27834ca9caf1fe64b2f224181f18db101c6f4803d9e11fd55e2383" :answer/id #uuid "603aa8ca-e92e-569a-a0d8-325560fdca22" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt{7}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{7}})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95865/selection/b2d426af3905d19365852c745eead87be28fbccf6cae8cd2e230b63b663d2e9e" :answer/id #uuid "bedebc53-e495-5548-9390-d170904112f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{7}})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95865/selection/abfa5b329ff0e9aaf066e0a8135b93ef05ad2e9b74776c019cf53442cdaa07d1" :answer/id #uuid "4a300a4e-5d98-53e2-a1bf-7a81608fc6bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{x}{7})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95865/selection/3